{"case_id":"smoke-ext-025-ioss-coverage","dataset_version":"m2-cross-border-rag-smoke-v1","split":"debug","question":"一笔进口远程销售要纳入IOSS，货物来源、内在价值、运输安排和消费税属性分别要满足什么条件？","language":"zh-CN","category":"cross_section_process","difficulty":"multi_step","source_group":"cross_border_core","expected_document_ids":["eval-doc-eu-vat-explanatory-notes-2026-en"],"expected_evidence_spans":[{"source_id":"eu-vat-explanatory-notes-2026-en","document_id":"eval-doc-eu-vat-explanatory-notes-2026-en","source_type":"pdf","page_start":59,"page_end":59,"exact_text":"Supplies of goods are covered by the import scheme when: • the goods are dispatched/transported from a third territory or third country at the time they are supplied, and • these goods are dispatched in a consignment of an intrinsic value not exceeding EUR 150, and • the goods are transported or dispatched by or on behalf of the supplier, including where the supplier intervenes indirectly in the dispatch or transport of the goods from a third country or third territory, to a customer or any other eligible person in a Member State, and • the goods are not subject to EU harmonised excise duties"}],"answer_key_points":["供应时从第三地区或第三国发运","单票内在价值不超过150欧元","由供应商或代表供应商运输或发运","货物不属于欧盟协调消费税应税货物"],"acceptable_answer_variants":[],"forbidden_claims":["消费税货物只要低于150欧元即可使用IOSS"],"should_answer":true,"expected_non_answer_reason":null,"trusted_user_fixture_id":"user-fixture-eval-reader","acl_fixture_id":"acl-fixture-public-eval","version_fixture_id":"version-fixture-active"}
{"case_id":"smoke-ext-026-oss-return-cycle","dataset_version":"m2-cross-border-rag-smoke-v1","split":"debug","question":"非欧盟计划、欧盟计划和进口计划的OSS申报频率分别是什么，选择计划后供应范围如何申报？","language":"zh-CN","category":"cross_section_process","difficulty":"multi_step","source_group":"cross_border_core","expected_document_ids":["eval-doc-eu-vat-oss-guidelines-2026-en"],"expected_evidence_spans":[{"source_id":"eu-vat-oss-guidelines-2026-en","document_id":"eval-doc-eu-vat-oss-guidelines-2026-en","source_type":"pdf","page_start":7,"page_end":7,"exact_text":"The VAT return is submitted quarterly in the non-Union and Union scheme and monthly in the import scheme. If a taxable person chooses to use one of the schemes, he has to declare all supplies that fall under that particular scheme via the OSS return of the respective scheme."}],"answer_key_points":["非欧盟计划和欧盟计划按季度申报","进口计划按月申报","选择某计划后须申报该计划范围内的全部供应"],"acceptable_answer_variants":[],"forbidden_claims":["可以只选择部分成员国的合格供应申报"],"should_answer":true,"expected_non_answer_reason":null,"trusted_user_fixture_id":"user-fixture-eval-reader","acl_fixture_id":"acl-fixture-public-eval","version_fixture_id":"version-fixture-active"}
{"case_id":"smoke-ext-027-fixed-duty","dataset_version":"m2-cross-border-rag-smoke-v1","split":"debug","question":"临时3欧元固定关税何时适用、按什么单位征收，并覆盖什么价值范围的进口远程销售？","language":"zh-CN","category":"cross_section_process","difficulty":"multi_step","source_group":"cross_border_core","expected_document_ids":["eval-doc-eu-vat-customs-duty-addendum-2026-en"],"expected_evidence_spans":[{"source_id":"eu-vat-customs-duty-addendum-2026-en","document_id":"eval-doc-eu-vat-customs-duty-addendum-2026-en","source_type":"pdf","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"exact_text":"VAT treatment of the EUR 3 customs duty on distance sales of imported goods not exceeding EUR 150 – from 1 July 2026 until 30 June 2028 Background: As from 1 July 2026, the customs duty exemption threshold of EUR 150 is abolished. In accordance with Council Regulation (EU) 2026/382 of 11 February 20261, a new temporary EUR 3 fixed customs duty applies per item supplied as a distance sale of imported goods (DSIG) in a consignment not exceeding EUR150."}],"answer_key_points":["适用期为2026年7月1日至2028年6月30日","每件商品征收3欧元","覆盖不超过150欧元的进口远程销售货物"],"acceptable_answer_variants":[],"forbidden_claims":["每票包裹固定征收3欧元"],"should_answer":true,"expected_non_answer_reason":null,"trusted_user_fixture_id":"user-fixture-eval-reader","acl_fixture_id":"acl-fixture-public-eval","version_fixture_id":"version-fixture-active"}
{"case_id":"smoke-ext-028-handling-fee-vat","dataset_version":"m2-cross-border-rag-smoke-v1","split":"debug","question":"欧盟统一处理费最早何时适用，为什么不计入进口VAT计税金额？","language":"zh-CN","category":"cross_section_process","difficulty":"multi_step","source_group":"cross_border_core","expected_document_ids":["eval-doc-eu-vat-customs-duty-addendum-2026-en"],"expected_evidence_spans":[{"source_id":"eu-vat-customs-duty-addendum-2026-en","document_id":"eval-doc-eu-vat-customs-duty-addendum-2026-en","source_type":"pdf","page_start":2,"page_end":2,"exact_text":"VAT treatment of the announced Union handling fee on distance sales of imported goods (applicable from November 2026 at the earliest) The Custom reform will introduce a new Union handling fee which is expected to apply to all distance sales as from November 2026. This handling fee is to be considered compensation for a service rendered by a public authority acting as such (Customs authorities) and therefore, outside the scope of VAT. Since the Union handling fee is not a customs duty, it shall not form part of the VAT taxable amount upon importation. Hence there is no VAT due on this Union handling fee."}],"answer_key_points":["最早自2026年11月适用","它是公共机关提供服务的补偿，处于VAT范围之外","它不是关税，因此不计入进口VAT计税金额"],"acceptable_answer_variants":[],"forbidden_claims":["该处理费属于关税"],"should_answer":true,"expected_non_answer_reason":null,"trusted_user_fixture_id":"user-fixture-eval-reader","acl_fixture_id":"acl-fixture-public-eval","version_fixture_id":"version-fixture-active"}
